<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY SIX-MONTH T-BILL YIELD RISES TO 19.67 PCT.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY SIX-MONTH T-BILL YIELD RISES TO 19.67 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of six-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 19.67 percent, up from 19.57 percent at an auction two weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	   16,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received    20,764.39 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	  16,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued	     17,500 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    19.67 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     91.0680 pct</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
